# ============================================================
# Generated artefacts
# ============================================================
# Trained model bundles are build outputs. The one committed to
# this repo is kept deliberately (the lecturer demo needs it),
# but any NEW bundle should not be committed -- retrain instead
# (scripts/train_model.py).
models/*.pkl
!models/best_model.pkl
*.log
reports/
exports/

